cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PyGaia in your research, please cite this software using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "PyGaia: Gaia science performance simulation toolkit"
abstract: >-
  PyGaia provides Python modules for the simulation of Gaia data and their
  uncertainties, as well as modules for the manipulation of the Gaia catalogue
  data, including transformations between astrometric observables and phase
  space variables, transformations between sky coordinate systems, and the
  propagation of the astrometric covariance matrix to different epochs.
